close_reason: "Delivered durable SDK-first extension migrations with dry-run planning, applied/skipped/failed receipts, retry and idempotency state, explicit CLI actions, runtime auto-application, health remediation, docs, and isolated acceptance."
body: "Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/909\\n\\nTurn extension_migration_pending from a permanent diagnostic into actionable state. The public primitive and thin CLI adapter must discover pending migrations, apply them under the existing lifecycle gate, persist idempotency state, report structured outcomes, and feed the exact remediation command into health and package diagnostics."
